#
# netflow_preview - metadata/default.meta
# Default object permissions. Scope is app-level (export = none) - objects are
# visible to all users within this app but not exported to other apps or system.
# Read is granted to all roles ([ * ]) so Splunk Cloud customers can access every
# knowledge object; write is restricted to admin/power. Change export to "system"
# only if other apps must reference these objects.
#

